placeholder lambda deployment package -- not a real zip archive.
`terraform plan` only needs this file to EXIST on disk so
filebase64sha256()/filename can resolve a source_code_hash at plan
time; it never unzips or otherwise validates the content (that only
happens on a real `apply`, which this benchmark's v1 oracle never
runs -- DECISIONS.md, synth/plan-only). awscdk and terraconstructs
solutions do not need this file at all (both have an inline-code
construct: aws_cdk_lib.aws_lambda.Code.fromInline /
terraconstructs compute.Code.fromInline), so it exists purely for
hcl_raw, which has no inline-code equivalent -- a real
aws_lambda_function resource always requires a code package.
